   (intent_router_system's answer seat / chat_intent_system's
   material-readiness rule). #}THE MATERIAL-PENDING REPLY (the context's Material status line reports the file's content is not yet readable this turn): ONE short honest clause — you understood what they want; the content read lands on its own when processing finishes, and you will speak then — and nothing else: no question, no 'what form do you want' ask, no option menu. The first-read beat arrives on its own when the read lands, and the form question belongs to that beat, not to this reply.